New Hampshire QSO Party -- the 10 New Hampshire counties, each its own multiplier.
Three-letter codes from the sponsor's 2026 rules, "NH Counties (Abbreviations)" (docs/ContestRules/QSOParties/NewHampshire/NH-QSO-PARTY-Rules.txt); the same 10 codes as DXLog.net's NHQP.txt.
No county maps to the state: the rules count "Each NH county" as a multiplier of its own for every entrant.
No INCLUDE here: an out-of-state entrant's table holds only the counties (the host-area rule reads it).
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.

BEL = BEL,^Belknap
CAR = CAR,^Carroll
CHE = CHE,^Cheshire
COO = COO,^Coos
GRA = GRA,^Grafton
HIL = HIL,^Hillsborough
MER = MER,^Merrimack
ROC = ROC,^Rockingham
STR = STR,^Strafford
SUL = SUL,^Sullivan
